<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">QUICK LOG</view><view class="title">记录</view><view class="mode"><view class="{{mode==='photo'?'active':''}}" data-mode="photo" bindtap="mode">拍照识别</view><view class="{{mode==='manual'?'active':''}}" data-mode="manual" bindtap="mode">手动记录</view></view><block wx:if="{{mode==='photo'}}"><view class="photo-box {{photo?'has-photo':''}}"><image wx:if="{{photo}}" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="photo-empty"><view class="camera-icon">⌁</view><text>把这一餐交给 AI 看</text><small>拍照或从相册选择，识别后都可以修改</small></view></view><view class="media-actions"><button class="camera-action" bindtap="pickCamera"><view class="media-icon">◎</view><view><text>拍照</text><small>现在拍这一餐</small></view></button><button class="album-action" bindtap="pickAlbum"><view class="media-icon">▧</view><view><text>相册</text><small>选择已有照片</small></view></button></view><input class="input context" placeholder="补充说明，可不填。例如：鸡腿去皮" value="{{context}}" bindinput="context"/><button class="btn-primary analyze" loading="{{analyzing}}" bindtap="analyze">{{items.length?'重新识别':'识别这顿饭'}}</button><view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="estimate surface"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">识别结果</view><text class="pill">{{items.length}} 项</text></view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="index" class="estimate-row"><input class="name" value="{{item.name}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-field="name" bindinput="editItem"/><view class="numbers"><label><input type="number" value="{{item.grams}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-field="grams" bindinput="editItem"/><text>g</text></label><label><input type="number" value="{{item.calories}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-field="calories" bindinput="editItem"/><text>kcal</text></label><view class="remove" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">×</view></view><view class="micro">P {{item.protein}} · C {{item.carbs}} · F {{item.fat}}</view></view><view class="total"><view><text>{{totals.calories}}</text><small> kcal</small></view><view class="total-macro">P {{totals.protein}}g · C {{totals.carbs}}g · F {{totals.fat}}g</view></view><button class="btn-primary" bindtap="savePhoto">确认并保存</button></view></block><block wx:else><view class="manual surface"><text class="label first">吃了什么</text><input class="input" placeholder="米饭 + 牛肉 + 蘑菇" data-key="name" bindinput="manualInput"/><view class="manual-grid"><view><text class="label">热量 kcal</text><input class="input" type="number" data-key="calories" bindinput="manualInput"/></view><view><text class="label">蛋白质 g</text><input class="input" type="number" data-key="protein" bindinput="manualInput"/></view><view><text class="label">碳水 g</text><input class="input" type="number" data-key="carbs" bindinput="manualInput"/></view><view><text class="label">脂肪 g</text><input class="input" type="number" data-key="fat" bindinput="manualInput"/></view></view><button class="btn-primary save-manual" bindtap="saveManual">保存这一餐</button></view></block></view>
